{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a post-apocalyptic survivor searching for other survivors in the endless desert, but, as the desert is filled with hostile mutated ancient creatures and an extremely harsh environment, it is up to you to assemble your own apocalyptic mech and pilot it to its destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use quantum technology to transform the volume and mass of any unit to assist in combat or decryption.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/1-en.gif?t=1743510323\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use the meat grinder to cut units up close and recycle resources.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/2-en.gif?t=1743510323\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can assemble your own mech as many times as you want using different components.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/3-en.gif?t=1743510323\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Get out of the shelter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2489250/8c15c50d0866729b8e0971e29e555789fd3e62bc.jpg"},{"name":"Rip your head off!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2489250/e048aed15a5d09a812fd7482af74f6b72571026d.jpg"},{"name":"Give me a lightning rod","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2489250/8f590aeb1d8aa43354f532685cd7bef0de5667ca.jpg"},{"name":"More and More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2489250/49fe89f3b9342dc39e31dd8257788c624f66b640.jpg"},{"name":"Extinction of the dinosaurs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2489250/ab72f8a623be