ilot it to its destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use quantum technology to transform the volume and mass of any unit to assist in combat or decryption.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/1-en.gif?t=1743510323\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use the meat grinder to cut units up close and recycle resources.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/2-en.gif?t=1743510323\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can assemble your own mech as many times as you want using different components.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/3-en.gif?t=1743510323\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["MistGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/286988c173f7fdc000833643456f21ac5b9e9a3a/header.jpg?t=1743510323","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256989408,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256989408/movie480.mp4?t=1743510322","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256989408/movie_max.mp4?t=1743510322"},"name":"1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256989408/cb32f3c14d48a9440a70bd19cd13f7bcb057d2a4/movie_600x3